flowchart LR
  subgraph U[Unbounded queue]
    U1[Producers] --> U2[Queue expands]
    U2 --> U3[Consumers stay fixed]
    U3 --> U4[Latency moves into backlog]
    U4 --> U5[Failure appears late]
  end

  subgraph B[Bounded queue]
    B1[Producers] --> B2[Queue hits limit]
    B2 --> B3[Enqueue blocks or fails]
    B3 --> B4[Upstream sees pressure]
    B4 --> B5[Load is shaped early]
  end
